steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1779446058
      nanos: 314037471
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Build a beautifully streamlined, professional \'Executive Tech\' agricultural prototype application named \"Kapas Ki Sehat\". \n\n### GLOBAL DESIGN LANGUAGE & THEME\n* Style: Clean, minimalist, high-contrast, professional \"Executive Tech\" aesthetic optimized for field legibility under direct sunlight.\n* Color Palette: Deep charcoal black (#121212) for the primary background, clean pristine whites/off-whites for content cards, professional mint-green (#99ff9a) for primary action items/buttons, and a rich wheat-gold (#e5c07b) for primary headers.\n* Geometry: Consistent 16px rounded corners on all cards and containers with a very subtle, elegant border line to separate elements.\n* Localization: The application must support highly visible Bilingual (English and Urdu) text layouts.\n\n### APPLICATION ARCHITECTURE (3-SCREEN FLOW)\n\n1. SCREEN ONE: HOME DASHBOARD (SIMPLIFIED & FOCUS DRIVEN)\n* Header Area: Clean, unobtrusive presentation of the \"Kapas Ki Sehat\" logo, \"Agri-Tech v2.4\" badge, and a single warm bilingual welcome line: \"As-Salamu Alaykum! Tap to begin scanning. / \330\247\331\204\330\263\331\204\330\247\331\205 \330\271\331\204\333\214\332\251\331\205! \330\247\330\263\332\251\333\214\331\206 \332\251\330\261\331\206\333\222 \332\251\333\222 \331\204\333\214\333\222 \331\271\333\214\331\276 \332\251\330\261\333\214\332\272\333\224\"\n* Unified Executive Status Card: A single, consolidated card titled \"DISTRICT HEALTH & RISK\" in a wheat-gold header font. It must display weather details for the \"MULTAN COTTON BELT\" using clean icons: \"37\302\260C Dry & Sunny / \332\257\330\261\331\205 \330\247\331\210\330\261 \330\256\330\264\332\251\", \"42% Humidity (Dry)\", and \"14 km/h Wind\". At the bottom of this card, feature a high-contrast, streamlined alert string: \"CRITICAL WHITEFLY RISK / \330\263\331\206\332\257\333\214\331\206 \330\256\330\267\330\261\333\201: High risk of Whitefly expansion due to continuous dry heat wave.\"\n* Primary Action Call-To-Action (The Hero Element): Positioned prominently in the center/lower half of the dashboard, create ONE massive, full-width, dominant mint-green (#99ff9a) action button. This button replaces all old cluttered cards and serves as the single entry point to the scanner.\n    * Button Text (Large, Bold, High Contrast): \n      Line 1: \"SCAN CROP\" (English)\n      Line 2: \"\332\251\331\276\330\247\330\263 \332\251\330\247 \331\276\330\252\333\201 \330\247\330\263\332\251\333\214\331\206 \332\251\330\261\333\214\332\272\" (Urdu)\n    * Iconography: Integrate a clean, distinctive camera scanner icon inside or adjacent to the text.\n    * Behavior: Clicking this massive button must cleanly route the user to Screen Two.\n\n2. SCREEN TWO: THE SCANNER VIEW (CAMERA WORKSPACE)\n* UI Layout: Simulate a full-screen native Android CameraX viewfinder. Apply a dark transparent overlay with a perfectly centered, crisp vector square frame cutout indicating where the farmer should align the cotton leaf sample.\n* Floating Controls: Include a prominent mint-green circular \'Capture\' button at the bottom of the frame.\n* Behavior: Clicking the capture button triggers an immediate 2-second full-screen loading state to simulate cloud/edge AI computation before navigating to Screen Three.\n* Loading Animation: Display a stylized spinning wheel labeled \"Kapas AI Diagnostic Matrix: Calibrating spectral channels... / \330\247\330\263\331\276\333\214\332\251\331\271\330\261\331\204 \332\251\333\214\331\204\333\214\330\250\330\261\333\214\330\264\331\206...\".\n\n3. SCREEN THREE: DIAGNOSIS RESULT PAGE\n* Title Header: \"Agro AI Log Engine / Leaves Scan Diagnostics\"\n* Identified Attack Section: Clear bold reading displaying \"Whitefly Infestation / \332\251\331\276\330\247\330\263 \332\251\333\214 \330\263\331\201\333\214\330\257 \331\205\332\251\332\276\333\214 \332\251\330\247 \330\255\331\205\331\204\333\201\".\n* Severity Gauge: A clean visual progress bar locked at 85% with an explicit high-contrast color indicator displaying \"85% Severity - High Alert / \330\263\331\206\332\257\333\214\331\206 \331\206\331\202\330\265\330\247\331\206 \332\251\330\247 \330\256\330\267\330\261\333\201\".\n* Structured Recommendations Card: A dedicated white card listing four precise agronomic bullet points:\n  1. Immediate chemical spray of Diafenthiuron (200ml/acre).\n  2. Deploy yellow sticky traps (40/acre) to catch adult flies.\n  3. Ensure a clean sprinkler flush to wash away sticky honeydew.\n  4. Avoid chemical cocktails that destroy predatory ladybugs.\n* Navigation Flow: Include a \"Save to Log\" action button that clears the state and routes the user smoothly back to the Home Dashboard.\n\nEnsure all component navigation, button presses, and state changes behave fluidly within the interactive browser preview window."
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Build an Android app\"\nicon: \"android_color\"\n---\n\n"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "Build a beautifully streamlined, professional \'Executive Tech\' agricultural prototype application named \"Kapas Ki Sehat\". \n\n### GLOBAL DESIGN LANGUAGE & THEME\n* Style: Clean, minimalist, high-contrast, professional \"Executive Tech\" aesthetic optimized for field legibility under direct sunlight.\n* Color Palette: Deep charcoal black (#121212) for the primary background, clean pristine whites/off-whites for content cards, professional mint-green (#99ff9a) for primary action items/buttons, and a rich wheat-gold (#e5c07b) for primary headers.\n* Geometry: Consistent 16px rounded corners on all cards and containers with a very subtle, elegant border line to separate elements.\n* Localization: The application must support highly visible Bilingual (English and Urdu) text layouts.\n\n### APPLICATION ARCHITECTURE (3-SCREEN FLOW)\n\n1. SCREEN ONE: HOME DASHBOARD (SIMPLIFIED & FOCUS DRIVEN)\n* Header Area: Clean, unobtrusive presentation of the \"Kapas Ki Sehat\" logo, \"Agri-Tech v2.4\" badge, and a single warm bilingual welcome line: \"As-Salamu Alaykum! Tap to begin scanning. / \330\247\331\204\330\263\331\204\330\247\331\205 \330\271\331\204\333\214\332\251\331\205! \330\247\330\263\332\251\333\214\331\206 \332\251\330\261\331\206\333\222 \332\251\333\222 \331\204\333\214\333\222 \331\271\333\214\331\276 \332\251\330\261\333\214\332\272\333\224\"\n* Unified Executive Status Card: A single, consolidated card titled \"DISTRICT HEALTH & RISK\" in a wheat-gold header font. It must display weather details for the \"MULTAN COTTON BELT\" using clean icons: \"37\302\260C Dry & Sunny / \332\257\330\261\331\205 \330\247\331\210\330\261 \330\256\330\264\332\251\", \"42% Humidity (Dry)\", and \"14 km/h Wind\". At the bottom of this card, feature a high-contrast, streamlined alert string: \"CRITICAL WHITEFLY RISK / \330\263\331\206\332\257\333\214\331\206 \330\256\330\267\330\261\333\201: High risk of Whitefly expansion due to continuous dry heat wave.\"\n* Primary Action Call-To-Action (The Hero Element): Positioned prominently in the center/lower half of the dashboard, create ONE massive, full-width, dominant mint-green (#99ff9a) action button. This button replaces all old cluttered cards and serves as the single entry point to the scanner.\n    * Button Text (Large, Bold, High Contrast): \n      Line 1: \"SCAN CROP\" (English)\n      Line 2: \"\332\251\331\276\330\247\330\263 \332\251\330\247 \331\276\330\252\333\201 \330\247\330\263\332\251\333\214\331\206 \332\251\330\261\333\214\332\272\" (Urdu)\n    * Iconography: Integrate a clean, distinctive camera scanner icon inside or adjacent to the text.\n    * Behavior: Clicking this massive button must cleanly route the user to Screen Two.\n\n2. SCREEN TWO: THE SCANNER VIEW (CAMERA WORKSPACE)\n* UI Layout: Simulate a full-screen native Android CameraX viewfinder. Apply a dark transparent overlay with a perfectly centered, crisp vector square frame cutout indicating where the farmer should align the cotton leaf sample.\n* Floating Controls: Include a prominent mint-green circular \'Capture\' button at the bottom of the frame.\n* Behavior: Clicking the capture button triggers an immediate 2-second full-screen loading state to simulate cloud/edge AI computation before navigating to Screen Three.\n* Loading Animation: Display a stylized spinning wheel labeled \"Kapas AI Diagnostic Matrix: Calibrating spectral channels... / \330\247\330\263\331\276\333\214\332\251\331\271\330\261\331\204 \332\251\333\214\331\204\333\214\330\250\330\261\333\214\330\264\331\206...\".\n\n3. SCREEN THREE: DIAGNOSIS RESULT PAGE\n* Title Header: \"Agro AI Log Engine / Leaves Scan Diagnostics\"\n* Identified Attack Section: Clear bold reading displaying \"Whitefly Infestation / \332\251\331\276\330\247\330\263 \332\251\333\214 \330\263\331\201\333\214\330\257 \331\205\332\251\332\276\333\214 \332\251\330\247 \330\255\331\205\331\204\333\201\".\n* Severity Gauge: A clean visual progress bar locked at 85% with an explicit high-contrast color indicator displaying \"85% Severity - High Alert / \330\263\331\206\332\257\333\214\331\206 \331\206\331\202\330\265\330\247\331\206 \332\251\330\247 \330\256\330\267\330\261\333\201\".\n* Structured Recommendations Card: A dedicated white card listing four precise agronomic bullet points:\n  1. Immediate chemical spray of Diafenthiuron (200ml/acre).\n  2. Deploy yellow sticky traps (40/acre) to catch adult flies.\n  3. Ensure a clean sprinkler flush to wash away sticky honeydew.\n  4. Avoid chemical cocktails that destroy predatory ladybugs.\n* Navigation Flow: Include a \"Save to Log\" action button that clears the state and routes the user smoothly back to the Home Dashboard.\n\nEnsure all component navigation, button presses, and state changes behave fluidly within the interactive browser preview window."
    }
  }
}
