  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-full w-full bg-[#121212] font-sans text-white overflow-hidden p-4\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Section -->\\n  <header class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#e5c07b]\\\">Kapas Ki Sehat</h1>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono opacity-50 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Agri-Tech v2.4</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#99ff9a] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase font-bold tracking-tighter\\\">Cloud Sync: Active</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Welcome Line -->\\n  <div class=\\\"mb-6 space-y-1\\\">\\n    <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">As-Salamu Alaykum! Tap to begin scanning.</p>\\n    <p class=\\\"text-lg font-bold leading-none tracking-wide text-right\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\330\247\331\204\330\263\331\204\330\247\331\205 \330\271\331\204\333\214\332\251\331\205! \330\247\330\263\332\251\333\214\331\206 \332\251\330\261\331\206\333\222 \332\251\333\222 \331\204\333\214\333\222 \331\271\333\214\331\276 \332\251\330\261\333\214\332\272\333\224</p>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Area (Flexible) -->\\n  <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n    <!-- Unified Executive Status Card -->\\n    <div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-[16px] p-5 shadow-2xl border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-[#e5c07b] text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest\\\">District Health & Risk</h2>\\n        <span class=\\\"bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md font-bold uppercase\\\">Multan Belt</span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 my-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-50\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-500 mb-1\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364-6.364l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707m12.728 0l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707M12 8a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8z\\\"></path></svg>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900\\\">37\302\260C</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">Dry/Sunny</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-50\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-500 mb-1\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3\\\"></path></svg>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900\\\">42%</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">Humidity</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-50\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 mb-1\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\\\"></path></svg>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900\\\">14 km/h</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">Wind Speed</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-lg p-3\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-red-700 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\\\">Critical Whitefly Risk</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-red-900 text-[11px] font-bold leading-tight\\\">\\n          High risk of Whitefly expansion due to continuous dry heat wave.\\n        </p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-red-900 text-[12px] font-bold leading-tight mt-1 text-right italic\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\\n          \330\263\331\206\332\257\333\214\331\206 \330\256\330\267\330\261\333\201: \331\205\330\263\331\204\330\263\331\204 \330\256\330\264\332\251 \332\257\330\261\331\205\333\214 \332\251\333\214 \331\210\330\254\333\201 \330\263\333\222 \330\263\331\201\333\214\330\257 \331\205\332\251\332\276\333\214 \332\251\333\222 \331\276\332\276\333\214\331\204\330\247\330\244 \332\251\330\247 \330\262\333\214\330\247\330\257\333\201 \330\256\330\267\330\261\333\201\333\224\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Primary Action Call-To-Action (The Hero Element) -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex items-center\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"w-full h-full bg-[#99ff9a] rounded-[24px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 transition-all active:scale-[0.98] active:bg-[#77e678] border-[4px] border-black/10 group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-black flex items-center justify-center text-[#99ff9a] shadow-xl group-active:shadow-inner\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-12 h-12\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n            <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h.93a2 2 0 001.664-.89l.812-1.22A2 2 0 0110.07 4h3.86a2 2 0 011.664.89l.812 1.22A2 2 0 0018.07 7H19a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z\\\"></path>\\n            <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M15 13a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\\\"></path>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-black text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-none\\\">Scan Crop</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-black text-xl font-bold mt-1\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\332\251\331\276\330\247\330\263 \332\251\330\247 \331\276\330\252\333\201 \330\247\330\263\332\251\333\214\331\206 \332\251\330\261\333\214\332\272</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Navigation Bar (App Shell feel) -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"flex justify-around items-center pt-4 border-t border-white/5\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#99ff9a] rounded-full mb-0.5\\\"></div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[9px] text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Home</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-30\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z\\\"></path></svg>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">History</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-30\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z\\\"></path></svg>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Expert</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-full w-full bg-[#121212] font-sans text-white overflow-hidden p-4\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Section -->\\n  <header class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#e5c07b]\\\">Kapas Ki Sehat</h1>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono opacity-50 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Agri-Tech v2.4</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#99ff9a] rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase font-bold tracking-tighter\\\">Cloud Sync: Active</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Welcome Line -->\\n  <div class=\\\"mb-6 space-y-1\\\">\\n    <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">As-Salamu Alaykum! Tap to begin scanning.</p>\\n    <p class=\\\"text-lg font-bold leading-none tracking-wide text-right\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\330\247\331\204\330\263\331\204\330\247\331\205 \330\271\331\204\333\214\332\251\331\205! \330\247\330\263\332\251\333\214\331\206 \332\251\330\261\331\206\333\222 \332\251\333\222 \331\204\333\214\333\222 \331\271\333\214\331\276 \332\251\330\261\333\214\332\272\333\224</p>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Area (Flexible) -->\\n  <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n    <!-- Unified Executive Status Card -->\\n    <div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-[16px] p-5 shadow-2xl border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-[#e5c07b] text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest\\\">District Health & Risk</h2>\\n        <span class=\\\"bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md font-bold uppercase\\\">Multan Belt</span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 my-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-50\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-500 mb-1\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364-6.364l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707m12.728 0l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707M12 8a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8z\\\"></path></svg>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900\\\">37\302\260C</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">Dry/Sunny</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-50\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-blue-500 mb-1\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3\\\"></path></svg>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900\\\">42%</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">Humidity</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-50\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 mb-1\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\\\"></path></svg>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900\\\">14 km/h</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">Wind Speed</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-lg p-3\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-red-700 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\\\">Critical Whitefly Risk</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-red-900 text-[11px] font-bold leading-tight\\\">\\n          High risk of Whitefly expansion due to continuous dry heat wave.\\n        </p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-red-900 text-[12px] font-bold leading-tight mt-1 text-right italic\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\\n          \330\263\331\206\332\257\333\214\331\206 \330\256\330\267\330\261\333\201: \331\205\330\263\331\204\330\263\331\204 \330\256\330\264\332\251 \332\257\330\261\331\205\333\214 \332\251\333\214 \331\210\330\254\333\201 \330\263\333\222 \330\263\331\201\333\214\330\257 \331\205\332\251\332\276\333\214 \332\251\333\222 \331\276\332\276\333\214\331\204\330\247\330\244 \332\251\330\247 \330\262\333\214\330\247\330\257\333\201 \330\256\330\267\330\261\333\201\333\224\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Primary Action Call-To-Action (The Hero Element) -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex items-center\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"w-full h-full bg-[#99ff9a] rounded-[24px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 transition-all active:scale-[0.98] active:bg-[#77e678] border-[4px] border-black/10 group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-black flex items-center justify-center text-[#99ff9a] shadow-xl group-active:shadow-inner\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"w-12 h-12\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n            <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h.93a2 2 0 001.664-.89l.812-1.22A2 2 0 0110.07 4h3.86a2 2 0 011.664.89l.812 1.22A2 2 0 0018.07 7H19a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z\\\"></path>\\n            <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M15 13a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\\\"></path>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-black text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-none\\\">Scan Crop</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-black text-xl font-bold mt-1\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\332\251\331\276\330\247\330\263 \332\251\330\247 \331\276\330\252\333\201 \330\247\330\263\332\251\333\214\331\206 \332\251\330\261\333\214\332\272</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Navigation Bar (App Shell feel) -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"flex justify-around items-center pt-4 border-t border-white/5\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#99ff9a] rounded-full mb-0.5\\\"></div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[9px] text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Home</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-30\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z\\\"></path></svg>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">History</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1 opacity-30\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z\\\"></path></svg>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Expert</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
