  user_input {
    user_response: "\"Modify the project architecture to use the Jameel Noori Nastaleeq font for all Urdu text strings.\n\nAdd the font configuration file to the project\'s font resource directory (res/font/jameel_noori_nastaleeq.ttf). If it is a placeholder or system font bundle, map it cleanly.\n\nDefine a custom Typography style in Jetpack Compose specifically for Urdu, assigning Font(R.font.jameel_noori_nastaleeq) as the primary FontFamily.\n\nIncrease the lineHeight slightly (by around 4dp to 6dp) and add a small padding buffer to all Urdu Text components. Nastaliq script has tall vertical ascenders and descenders that will get clipped on Android if the line height is too tight.\n\nApply this new Urdu font style globally to the welcome header string and the \'Scan Crop\' Urdu button text.\""
    items {
      text: "\"Modify the project architecture to use the Jameel Noori Nastaleeq font for all Urdu text strings.\n\nAdd the font configuration file to the project\'s font resource directory (res/font/jameel_noori_nastaleeq.ttf). If it is a placeholder or system font bundle, map it cleanly.\n\nDefine a custom Typography style in Jetpack Compose specifically for Urdu, assigning Font(R.font.jameel_noori_nastaleeq) as the primary FontFamily.\n\nIncrease the lineHeight slightly (by around 4dp to 6dp) and add a small padding buffer to all Urdu Text components. Nastaliq script has tall vertical ascenders and descenders that will get clipped on Android if the line height is too tight.\n\nApply this new Urdu font style globally to the welcome header string and the \'Scan Crop\' Urdu button text.\""
    }
  }
}
