    summary: "Several GitHub repositories host the \"Jameel Noori Nastaleeq\" font in TTF format.\n\nOne option is the `abid-mujtaba/ttf-jameel-noori-nastaleeq` repository, which contains an AUR installer for the font for Arch Linux users[1]. The `Jameel Noori Nastaleeq.ttf` file itself is directly available within this repository[2].\n\nAnother repository, `ar-at-localhost/urdu-fonts-collection`, also includes \"Jameel Noori Nastaleeq.ttf\" among a collection of Urdu fonts[3].\n\nFor Android users, the `Hassan-kareem/Nastaliq-Urdu_font` repository offers releases for Jameel Noori Nastaleeq, Noto Nastaliq Urdu, and Mehr Nastaliq fonts, with both Kasheeda and Regular variants[4][5]. Similarly, `kamilmirza/Urdu-Fonts-Nastaliq` provides Jameel Noori Nastaliq v2 with separate bold style font support for Android 10 and Magisk v20+[6].\n\nThe font is also available on the Internet Archive, although it\'s noted that the file size is large, which might impact mobile devices[7].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEzr5xA9ZFUg3hhHPpjWXOlf5K6Qg4Vq6AwfKMcUo9941RoESKp2rScoFsx9PLXXsFYEPf2ScTSYCrwMD9mMHgwvzyAIo8jKC-KpR_KldOIuRG7t2bKNcZBBTi86GCXq73zZpKla-fSt49VzZpselSFXbXvpA==)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGezzwBlZRN_wV8BhRO7N6k25g8oiIytWhcttho6rzeFGWqeJzyno_2GElfMIFM5xnoY7Zf2nI7K5VUP2scHnSHbHv6WD2gJog3kl-V73S_m6SNWxz-LVjQGmTJWt0Boi4dF0sPIx09owTGUxpYJo3BDAqtxOJLPPkzz0f9JLggMMfYJzTFxtdLXo0Cw0EIQldMencf_u3aGJs7j8W544g=)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGVIsi7_069WnF0Ew1g5sy4GHqXISQHWNZLsW2l9SOp94fT9TobfnwcFHRnuUPLmONolLuqfV1SuTmt1y78jVoTe9jsjMma2XYqyvjcp2FnO5et4ytvxR9VxgAdYndf8qOKChhS0jNZr8PbOgf-Yo6QwyXYFhXPwQy6WKrPfJb4nowPSIIxE8RE-yY=)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHi8eHWCjVVCu9LID0JuZVWkRronIdS8t20-Wdv0cVdB5i4qowqFvPI631sGVpqrB98ubmQXTlb6iqFm5dWBZBlE7uFw0kMVj-hNoOOkZgPVZxQXPWBfVrekeuMN3qvKJBPlQzgHzcHIFwZvpSR)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEnEIIuN5uDIlrCf9eCG2E32037PHV014-A6Cuc09GOkhyeMb1UFxknc9-tX-erckwcAJF-QBGo89FP17MxCtyandh6tkM3PQa1L7N4XG5jW8pVeHIxEYYcGaWY0wmv-rsYR0vyBfPxavUA02BXPMRVHEpStEC9)\n[6] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHVzrqxKOiMbi4JkJQ0Db76avYiKs4SG8iX6Z98RKMbmSkVgDjqXwGckI5xcdTumcJAJ753-E0EE1oomtD_O0RrPQKvGGn1AHpZqDRgc4NQlMRaBSWJ4Uxwecl-4pozliZq0icF8LI7cEKUgJYeNMLBJwnYFg==)\n[7] [archive.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEh74aabeQwVINSlqmATyHnLhIiLkdwbmdRY_37wBZqqN_tQp7rpf58GcNA3CNr6B5RoAUj5rDdlNmsBP2TkgCsVmKtdo4guV8D0ougZF-wUA9--u94Gxd23rSeui90ceUw_tunYG46U74T36c=)"
