  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "\"We need to standardize the global layout and fix a cryptographic certificate issue preventing the dynamic font from loading on the physical device. Please implement the following:\n\nSTANDARDIZE NAVIGATION PADDING:\n\nRemove any hardcoded padding(bottom = 16.dp) from the individual screen navigation components.\n\nEnsure the entire application architecture is wrapped in a single Material 3 Scaffold.\n\nPlace the navigation items inside the global bottomBar slot of this Scaffold so the tabs anchor consistently across the Home, History, and Expert screens using native WindowInsets.navigationBars.\n\nFIX GOOGLE FONTS CERTIFICATES:\n\nThe \'Noto Nastaliq Urdu\' font is silently failing to download because the provider certificates are missing or invalid.\n\nExplicitly generate and populate the correct res/values/font_certs.xml array required for com.google.android.gms.fonts.\n\nEnsure Type.kt correctly references this certificate array in the GoogleFont.Provider.\n\nAdd a secondary fallback to FontFamily.Serif in the UrduTypography TextStyle so that if the download is ever delayed, it defaults to a slightly more readable serif style rather than rigid Naskh.\""
    items {
      text: "\"We need to standardize the global layout and fix a cryptographic certificate issue preventing the dynamic font from loading on the physical device. Please implement the following:\n\nSTANDARDIZE NAVIGATION PADDING:\n\nRemove any hardcoded padding(bottom = 16.dp) from the individual screen navigation components.\n\nEnsure the entire application architecture is wrapped in a single Material 3 Scaffold.\n\nPlace the navigation items inside the global bottomBar slot of this Scaffold so the tabs anchor consistently across the Home, History, and Expert screens using native WindowInsets.navigationBars.\n\nFIX GOOGLE FONTS CERTIFICATES:\n\nThe \'Noto Nastaliq Urdu\' font is silently failing to download because the provider certificates are missing or invalid.\n\nExplicitly generate and populate the correct res/values/font_certs.xml array required for com.google.android.gms.fonts.\n\nEnsure Type.kt correctly references this certificate array in the GoogleFont.Provider.\n\nAdd a secondary fallback to FontFamily.Serif in the UrduTypography TextStyle so that if the download is ever delayed, it defaults to a slightly more readable serif style rather than rigid Naskh.\""
    }
  }
}
