    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGteDHQm72DO3R8GS1TY4NdHl-_65ow_JyN-l99ig22hZ7jkSoYgIdvZSFpVmt1rAf80SLP14QqVB2Na3s0IL3ktlvu8ZLOfP6r9p-uzn_SLWciI0IPRR7eZPYYXhqiEHlNhLPK72uL7EY-W4ETcI5YzjniW25x"
      title: "android.com"
    }
    summary: "The search for \"font_certs.xml\" specifically on `raw.githubusercontent.com` did not return direct links to `raw.githubusercontent.com` containing the file itself. However, the search results consistently indicate that `font_certs.xml` is an Android-related file.\n\n`font_certs.xml` is a file generated by Android Studio when using downloadable fonts from Google Fonts[1][2][3][4]. It contains certificates used by the Android system to verify the identity of the font provider, ensuring that fonts are downloaded from a trusted source[2][4]. This file is typically found in the `values` folder of an Android project[1].\n\nWhen you choose to create a downloadable font in Android Studio, it automatically generates three files: a font XML file (e.g., `lato.xml`), `font_certs.xml`, and `preloaded_fonts.xml`[2][3][4]. For developers using Jetpack Compose, the `font_certs.xml` file provides the necessary hashes for certificates to verify the Google Fonts provider[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGs9nn42uWY61HIVuG6PhNFWIUSf3Rc5QuXHx9pIE81mxrjmpRxFYgJFPrd3UVa7DRTlrb_2PBf_9DH6ZqcMNsOdI0E2OyRLPjL6QL_2fwj_JbDuRR6VRPmC3ru6chc_nqJJquDmottz4aQIudADEHjNqD-cOxtztE8tV3TcvJT60Yx3i8qN0Meuwy0qZsGOCOWYA==)\n[2] [mindorks.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGO-heB2BeXysTj0dcXN2HtbamPDqXew4FQHImZ38aT5NbRicIQAOilKy15XUauq20kFkF7ZSfDsi1zD43HVwmriRdqmC4WbltofN_syRkTygGBGzSpqsThapPLxacve2vdM-2UwX_JLdJsDsOS5h1U7ssXw_-QT7p84ri3HiLH3SMM4NA=)\n[3] [dladukedev.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFFfnEvOf4tI-EJmdY93roe8XUx8y1PJNcr3LtHrq68zTbwsXmYznMyOPabMvzBf7Z6E5PMpiwxFmbbpOBZranDP-R5ro_AC4PUAP7mZUZg3yxP9pUCFgfU7vDZLVny6AuULPPZ0-bsahLgGUr-Fv672D9LL2aOmTY=)\n[4] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGfZk0LzodZt7otX6GmesZkDGfQJZc3VtBGHyRuugHSynBQHNEieb3NKP4YvzzSloPApjhEyZ-boViQlEvF-qK9Xlh-9qg-r2sHzoJ